&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Freenow is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is looking for you to join our Patient Marketing team in&lt;strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in B2C SEO and AI Search (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Patient Marketing helps Doctolib reach patients in Germany with relevant, useful content and strengthen access to healthcare. In this role, you will support content discoverability, content quality, conversion, data analysis, and AI-supported search initiatives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a working student in B2C SEO and AI Search, you will support us in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content SEO, CMS and editing: support content strategies, maintain WordPress content, and optimize copy for patients and search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keyword research, competitor analysis, and reporting: analyze the German health market and monitor SEO performance using tools such as Google Search Console and Semrush&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI search and cross-functional support: explore generative-AI-supported SEO work and collaborate with B2C Marketing and Patient Content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working with us, you will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How SEO and AI search are applied in a fast-growing health-tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience in content optimization, CMS workflows, and SEO analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to collaborate across local and international marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You could be our next team mate if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are studying marketing, media, communications, journalism, business administration, or a similar field, can work up to 20 hours per week during the semester, and have excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak&lt;strong&gt; German C2 and English C1 level&lt;/strong&gt;; French or Italian is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with a CMS such as WordPress and with AI tools such as Claude, Gemini, or ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Now, it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have first experience in SEO or content marketing and with tools such as Google Search Console or Keyword Planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have initial experience with Canva or an interest in translation and generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience in marketing, communications, journalism, editorial work, publishing, or healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and personalized onboarding program through our &lt;strong&gt;Doctolib Academy&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as a wide range of in-house training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible working model&lt;/strong&gt; that allows for hybrid and office-based work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Deutschlandticket &lt;/strong&gt;sponsored by Doctolib, or &lt;strong&gt;reimbursement of your semester ticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;28 vacation days&lt;/strong&gt; per year (calculated pro rata according to your working schedule)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity to work from EU countries or the UK for up to 10 days per year (eligible after 6 months)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company health insurance&lt;/strong&gt; with many additional benefits and subsidies (eligible after 6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular breakfast in the office and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;subsidies for your lunch or grocery shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;subsidized sports program&lt;/strong&gt; with our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Interview with the Hiring Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study Interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working Student in part-time: up to 20 hours per week&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace: Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €15 gross/hour - (€16 gross/hour from January 2027)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date:&amp;nbsp; November 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid setup with 2 office days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Products integrates GitLab and third-party SDLC data, and builds the dashboards, APIs, and data products that turn it into trusted, interoperable intelligence for customers and internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a 0 to 1 team and we are hiring for a foundational engineering role. That means you bring technical leadership through ambiguity, helping figure out what to build, making the foundational design decisions, and keeping delivery moving while the picture is still forming. You own the full lifecycle of what ships and stand behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence as a Staff owning product or platform systems end to end across multiple engineering and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency, i.e finds the owner, clarifies the path, makes the call, and keeps pushing until the work lands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Force multiplier and raise the people and the codebase around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep full-stack expertise, including strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Go, Ruby &lt;/strong&gt;and&lt;strong&gt; Node&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in at least one of analytics and metrics platforms, graph data systems, CDC and warehouse integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building production AI-powered tool orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating multi-tenant systems across SaaS and self-managed deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct communicator who builds alignment across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias to write things down and make reasoning legible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect how GitLab and third-party data is ingested, modeled, and synced into the knowledge graph as a near-real-time graph of the development ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration with external systems for business context (Jira, observability tools, Zendesk, ServiceNow), indexed into the graph.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the Data Marketplace so customers consume GitLab data through Snowflake, Databricks, and BigQuery with no engineering dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publish GitLab observability as OpenTelemetry and broker the data-sharing APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define operational readiness for everything the team ships across GitLab.com, Dedicated, and Self-Managed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate an ambiguous 0 to 1 problem space into concrete, iterable roadmaps in partnership with Product, Design, and the graph backend team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve cross-team dependencies across graph backend, AI Platform, and Infrastructure without escalating everything upward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior and intermediate engineers through design reviews, pairing, and code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create organizational leverage through speed. You identify systemic bottlenecks, simplify processes, and design systems that dramatically improve execution velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Products work across three surfaces:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard and Reporting Framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds AI-native dashboard components so customers and internal teams can see engineering health and GitLab&#39;s impact across DORA, VSA, AI Impact, SDLC trends, security, and quality, and launch their own custom dashboards on the same framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Ingestion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ingests third-party data into the GitLab and power tools like Knowledge Graph, building connectors so that signals from systems like Jira, Zendesk, ServiceNow, and observability tools become one queryable, near-real-time graph of the developer ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Ingestion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;External makes GitLab and Knowledge Graph data consumable outside the product, through marketplace listings, data-sharing APIs and SDKs, and co-branded partner products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a new team in a highly ambiguous, high-impact space, and we need engineers who can create clarity while building, make practical tradeoffs, unblock cross-team dependencies, and keep pushing until meaningful customer value lands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$152,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$259,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Contracts Manager, Commercial (EMEA), you’ll help keep GitLab’s commercial contracting moving by managing a varied pipeline of customer agreements, from established contracting work to more involved and complex negotiations. You’ll work closely with sales and internal teams to keep deals on track while protecting GitLab’s interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of the team that helps GitLab do business every day, bringing pace, precision, and good judgment to a broad range of commercial legal work. In this hands-on role, you’ll keep the day-to-day contracting work moving while also contributing to various strategic enterprise deals across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Director of Legal and work with a collaborative team that values clear advice, pragmatism, and a willingness to to roll up your sleeves. You’ll also help improve the playbooks, tools, and processes that make commercial contracting more consistent and scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a pipeline of commercial agreements across varying levels of complexity and stakeholder needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and review subscription agreements, artificial intelligence terms, regulatory annexes, professional services agreements, non-disclosure agreements, and related commercial documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate contract terms directly with customer counterparts in a way that supports deal progress and protects GitLab&#39;s legal and business interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with sales teams and internal stakeholders to provide clear, timely guidance on contracting questions throughout the deal cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess contractual risk across your caseload and translate legal issues into practical options and recommendations for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales enablement by creating practical guidance and helping sales team members understand and navigate contract terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve team playbooks, templates, and process documentation to support consistent, scalable contracting practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial contracts in a software or technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of technology-related agreements, including complex commercial arrangements, and contracts with structured regulatory or licensing considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance business goals with legal risk using a practical, solutions-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill in explaining contractual concepts clearly to non-legal stakeholders and external counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across geographies and time zones, with awareness of differing commercial and regulatory norms in global contracting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Workspace and contract lifecycle management tools; experience with Ironclad is useful, and openness to learning GitLab&#39;s tools and workflows is important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in AI tools and practical familiarity with their use in legal or commercial workflows, together with a thoughtful approach to their opportunities and limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, with additional language skills welcomed because they can support collaboration and negotiation across diverse markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in French is a distinct advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transferable experience from remote or asynchronous environments, or readiness to work effectively in that model, along with a law degree, paralegal certificate, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK or Ireland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Commercial Legal team partners with sales and business stakeholders to support GitLab&#39;s revenue motion in a responsible and efficient way. The team manages contracting across GitLab&#39;s global customer base, including software as a service, self-managed, and hybrid deployment models, along with terms related to artificial intelligence and the broader platform direction. The team works asynchronously across time zones and relies on strong documentation, pragmatism, and mutual support to keep pace with a fast-moving business. A key focus is helping the company scale commercial contracting while staying clear on risk and enabling deals effectively. For more on how this team works, see Link:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhandbook%2Egitlab%2Ecom%2Fhandbook%2Flegal%2Fcommercial%2F&amp;amp;urlhash=QP3-&amp;amp;mt=5Tf1vbMrPp7l20mVgYhC_9hnU0Y39pcjSGqYlODWRJ5-oD5E-CfM3hzMD4b2ULGmbJpdJIlEMmlBxVYhDuLz9Y5UbRQ&amp;amp;isSdui=true&quot;&gt; Commercial Legal Handbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
